# ===== docs/ =====
# docs/ holds repository documentation only. Anything else landing here is output from
# the super-admin Download Centre — real ticket data and customer files mirrored out of
# the running app. Allowlist what we actually commit; ignore everything else.
docs/*
!docs/FEATURES.md
!docs/Neurix-Technical-Documentation.pdf
!docs/neurix-documentation.html
!docs/preview-cover.png
!docs/preview-design-system.png
!docs/video/
# Rendered promo videos are large binaries; the poster frame is small enough to keep.
docs/video/*.mp4
docs/video/*.webm
